Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_ojpeg.c
Line: 2155
Function: OJPEGReadHeaderInfoSecTablesAcTable
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Unsigned underflow in loop bound: for (n = 0; n < m - 1; n++) with m as uint8_t. When m == 0 (and actable_offset[0] != 0), m - 1 wraps to 255, leading to out-of-bounds reads from sp->actable_offset[n].

Source context:
```c
